<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose May 12.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose May 12.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				  May 12		  May 9</p>
<p>Fed acct			16.546		 13.055</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  38.595		 38.647</p>
<p>Cash balance		  55.144		 51.702</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,248.172	     5,245.342</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $11 million were issued and $19 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
